# Rebuild dist after every change

The unpacked extension loads from `dist/`. After any edit that affects the extension, rebuild before finishing.

Applies to: `src/**`, `public/**`, `index.html`, `vite.config.*`, Tailwind/PostCSS, `package.json`.

If a watcher is already running (`npm run build:watch` or `npm run dev:extension`) and rebuilt after your edits, do not start another.

Otherwise:

```bash
npm run build
```

Wait until the command exits. Do not skip this for small UI or copy changes. Chrome will keep serving the old `dist/` until it is rebuilt.
